{"title":"Python爬虫实战：利用urllib获取豆瓣电影Top榜单数据","slug":"2024-07-26-urllib_get请求豆瓣电影前十页","date":"2024-07-26T04:49:51.000Z","updated":"2026-05-14T05:56:56.105Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/2024-07-26-urllib_get请求豆瓣电影前十页.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在进行网络爬虫学习时，豆瓣电影往往是绝佳的练手对象。本文将使用 Python 内置的标准库 <code>urllib</code>，无需安装第三方库，实现豆瓣电影剧情片榜单前十页数据的抓取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一、-需求分析与URL构造\"><a href=\"#一、-需求分析与URL构造\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、 需求分析与URL构造\"></a>一、 需求分析与URL构造</h2><p>我们要抓取的目标是豆瓣电影剧情片榜单。通过观察浏览器开发者工具（F12）中的网络请求，我们可以发现数据接口（API）的规律。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-观察URL规律\"><a href=\"#1-观察URL规律\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 观察URL规律\"></a>1. 观察URL规律</h3><p>通过翻页观察，我们可以发现请求地址中包含两个关键参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>start</code>：数据的起始偏移量。</li>\n<li><code>limit</code>：每页返回的数据条数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一页：<code>start=0&amp;limit=20</code></li>\n<li>第二页：<code>start=20&amp;limit=20</code></li>\n<li>第三页：<code>start=40&amp;limit=20</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-推导分页公式\"><a href=\"#2-推导分页公式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 推导分页公式\"></a>2. 推导分页公式</h3><p>假设当前页码为 <code>page</code>（从1开始），则 <code>start</code> 参数的计算公式为：<br><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">start = (page - <span class=\"number\">1</span>) * <span class=\"number\">20</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">由于我们使用的是 `<span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">10</span>)` 生成 <span class=\"number\">0</span>-<span class=\"number\">9</span> 的索引，代码中可以直接使用 `i * <span class=\"number\">20</span>` 来对应第 `i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>` 页。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 二、 代码实现</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在明确了逻辑后，我们采用模块化设计的思路，将功能拆分为 `下载页面`、`解析保存` 和 `主流程控制` 三个部分。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 导入urllib的标准请求模块</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">download_page</span>(<span class=\"params\">url</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    发送HTTP GET请求，获取页面源码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    :param url: 目标URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    :return: 解码后的HTML字符串</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 1. 构造请求头，模拟浏览器访问（反爬虫基础手段）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.3&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 2. 创建Request对象，将headers注入请求中</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    req = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 3. 发起请求并读取响应</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    response = urllib.request.urlopen(req)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 4. 解码响应体（豆瓣网页通常使用UTF-8编码）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">parse_page</span>(<span class=\"params\">html, i</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    将获取到的数据保存到本地文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    :param html: 页面内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    :param i: 文件序号/页码索引</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 以追加模式写入JSON文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    filename = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;douban_&#x27;</span> + <span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(i) + <span class=\"string\">&#x27;.json&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(filename, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, encoding=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f.write(html)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;第 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>&#125;</span> 页数据已保存至 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;filename&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    主函数：控制爬虫流程</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    base_url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://movie.douban.com/j/chart/top_list?type=17&amp;interval_id=100%3A90&amp;action=&amp;&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 爬取前10页数据</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">10</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 构造带分页参数的完整URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># start参数：第1页为0，第2页为20，依此类推</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        url = base_url + <span class=\"string\">&#x27;start=&#x27;</span> + <span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(i * <span class=\"number\">20</span>) + <span class=\"string\">&#x27;&amp;limit=20&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 下载页面</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        html = download_page(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 解析并保存</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        parse_page(html, i)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    main()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 三、 核心技术点解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 1. UA伪装（User-Agent）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">豆瓣对于爬虫请求有一定的限制。如果在请求头中不包含 `User-Agent`，服务器可能会拒绝访问或返回错误数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\">代码中通过 `urllib.request.Request` 对象的 `headers` 参数，将请求伪装成 Chrome 浏览器，这是爬虫开发中最基础也是最重要的步骤。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. urllib 的基本使用流程</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">相比于 `requests` 库，`urllib` 作为标准库，其调用链稍显繁琐，但在无第三方库环境下是首选：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  构建 `Request` 对象（包含 URL 和 Headers）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  使用 `urlopen()` 发送请求。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  调用 `read()` 读取二进制流。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  使用 `decode()` 解码为字符串。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 3. 数据存储</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">本例中接口直接返回的是 JSON 格式的字符串，因此我们可以直接将 `html` 内容写入 `.json` 文件，无需额外的解析步骤（如 XPath 或 BeautifulSoup），大大简化了流程。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 四、 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文通过一个简单的实战案例，演示了如何利用 `urllib` 进行分页数据的抓取。关键在于分析 URL 参数的变化规律以及正确设置请求头。对于更复杂的场景，建议后续学习 `requests` 库以及更高级的反爬策略。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&gt; **注意**：爬虫运行时请遵守网站的 `robots.txt` 协议，并控制请求频率，避免对服务器造成过大压力。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n","more":"<h2 id=\"前言\"><a href=\"#前言\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"前言\"></a>前言</h2><p>在进行网络爬虫学习时，豆瓣电影往往是绝佳的练手对象。本文将使用 Python 内置的标准库 <code>urllib</code>，无需安装第三方库，实现豆瓣电影剧情片榜单前十页数据的抓取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一、-需求分析与URL构造\"><a href=\"#一、-需求分析与URL构造\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、 需求分析与URL构造\"></a>一、 需求分析与URL构造</h2><p>我们要抓取的目标是豆瓣电影剧情片榜单。通过观察浏览器开发者工具（F12）中的网络请求，我们可以发现数据接口（API）的规律。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-观察URL规律\"><a href=\"#1-观察URL规律\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 观察URL规律\"></a>1. 观察URL规律</h3><p>通过翻页观察，我们可以发现请求地址中包含两个关键参数：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>start</code>：数据的起始偏移量。</li>\n<li><code>limit</code>：每页返回的数据条数。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>例如：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一页：<code>start=0&amp;limit=20</code></li>\n<li>第二页：<code>start=20&amp;limit=20</code></li>\n<li>第三页：<code>start=40&amp;limit=20</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"2-推导分页公式\"><a href=\"#2-推导分页公式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 推导分页公式\"></a>2. 推导分页公式</h3><p>假设当前页码为 <code>page</code>（从1开始），则 <code>start</code> 参数的计算公式为：<br><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br><span class=\"line\">58</span><br><span class=\"line\">59</span><br><span class=\"line\">60</span><br><span class=\"line\">61</span><br><span class=\"line\">62</span><br><span class=\"line\">63</span><br><span class=\"line\">64</span><br><span class=\"line\">65</span><br><span class=\"line\">66</span><br><span class=\"line\">67</span><br><span class=\"line\">68</span><br><span class=\"line\">69</span><br><span class=\"line\">70</span><br><span class=\"line\">71</span><br><span class=\"line\">72</span><br><span class=\"line\">73</span><br><span class=\"line\">74</span><br><span class=\"line\">75</span><br><span class=\"line\">76</span><br><span class=\"line\">77</span><br><span class=\"line\">78</span><br><span class=\"line\">79</span><br><span class=\"line\">80</span><br><span class=\"line\">81</span><br><span class=\"line\">82</span><br><span class=\"line\">83</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">start = (page - <span class=\"number\">1</span>) * <span class=\"number\">20</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">由于我们使用的是 `<span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">10</span>)` 生成 <span class=\"number\">0</span>-<span class=\"number\">9</span> 的索引，代码中可以直接使用 `i * <span class=\"number\">20</span>` 来对应第 `i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>` 页。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 二、 代码实现</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">在明确了逻辑后，我们采用模块化设计的思路，将功能拆分为 `下载页面`、`解析保存` 和 `主流程控制` 三个部分。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">```python</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 导入urllib的标准请求模块</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> urllib.request</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">download_page</span>(<span class=\"params\">url</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    发送HTTP GET请求，获取页面源码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    :param url: 目标URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    :return: 解码后的HTML字符串</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 1. 构造请求头，模拟浏览器访问（反爬虫基础手段）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/58.0.3029.110 Safari/537.3&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 2. 创建Request对象，将headers注入请求中</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    req = urllib.request.Request(url=url, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 3. 发起请求并读取响应</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    response = urllib.request.urlopen(req)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 4. 解码响应体（豆瓣网页通常使用UTF-8编码）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> response.read().decode(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">parse_page</span>(<span class=\"params\">html, i</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    将获取到的数据保存到本地文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    :param html: 页面内容</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    :param i: 文件序号/页码索引</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 以追加模式写入JSON文件</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    filename = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;douban_&#x27;</span> + <span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(i) + <span class=\"string\">&#x27;.json&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(filename, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>, encoding=<span class=\"string\">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        f.write(html)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;第 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;i+<span class=\"number\">1</span>&#125;</span> 页数据已保存至 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;filename&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    主函数：控制爬虫流程</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"string\">    &quot;&quot;&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    base_url = <span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://movie.douban.com/j/chart/top_list?type=17&amp;interval_id=100%3A90&amp;action=&amp;&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    </span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 爬取前10页数据</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> i <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">10</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 构造带分页参数的完整URL</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># start参数：第1页为0，第2页为20，依此类推</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        url = base_url + <span class=\"string\">&#x27;start=&#x27;</span> + <span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(i * <span class=\"number\">20</span>) + <span class=\"string\">&#x27;&amp;limit=20&#x27;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 下载页面</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        html = download_page(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        </span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"comment\"># 解析并保存</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        parse_page(html, i)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&#x27;__main__&#x27;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    main()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 三、 核心技术点解析</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 1. UA伪装（User-Agent）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">豆瓣对于爬虫请求有一定的限制。如果在请求头中不包含 `User-Agent`，服务器可能会拒绝访问或返回错误数据。</span><br><span class=\"line\">代码中通过 `urllib.request.Request` 对象的 `headers` 参数，将请求伪装成 Chrome 浏览器，这是爬虫开发中最基础也是最重要的步骤。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 2. urllib 的基本使用流程</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">相比于 `requests` 库，`urllib` 作为标准库，其调用链稍显繁琐，但在无第三方库环境下是首选：</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">1.</span>  构建 `Request` 对象（包含 URL 和 Headers）。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">2.</span>  使用 `urlopen()` 发送请求。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">3.</span>  调用 `read()` 读取二进制流。</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"number\">4.</span>  使用 `decode()` 解码为字符串。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">### 3. 数据存储</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">本例中接口直接返回的是 JSON 格式的字符串，因此我们可以直接将 `html` 内容写入 `.json` 文件，无需额外的解析步骤（如 XPath 或 BeautifulSoup），大大简化了流程。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">## 四、 总结</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">本文通过一个简单的实战案例，演示了如何利用 `urllib` 进行分页数据的抓取。关键在于分析 URL 参数的变化规律以及正确设置请求头。对于更复杂的场景，建议后续学习 `requests` 库以及更高级的反爬策略。</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">&gt; **注意**：爬虫运行时请遵守网站的 `robots.txt` 协议，并控制请求频率，避免对服务器造成过大压力。</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>\n","categories":[{"name":"技术实战","path":"api/categories/技术实战.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Python","path":"api/tags/Python.json"},{"name":"Spider","path":"api/tags/Spider.json"},{"name":"urllib","path":"api/tags/urllib.json"}]}